  m_Name: S06_Hazard_Wet_Floor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Valari.Data.TutorialData
  <Title>k__BackingField: "Identify Hazard 1 \u2014 Wet Floor"
  <Description>k__BackingField: Near Aisle B you will see a yellow wet floor sign
    next to a spill on the concrete. Wet floors are a leading cause of slip-and-fall
    injuries in warehouse environments. The risk increases significantly when workers
    are moving quickly, carrying loads, or wearing footwear without adequate grip.
    When you see a wet floor, do not walk through it. Confirm the sign is in place,
    keep others away, and report it to a supervisor so the spill can be cleaned.
    Point your controller at the hazard and press trigger to log it.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 840f35bf789fc6a41ae63ec1657aae7c, type: 3}
  <HasChallenges>k__BackingField: 1
  <IsInOrder>k__BackingField: 0
  TutorialChallengeLists:
  - <ChallengeTitle>k__BackingField: Log the Wet Floor Hazard
    <ChallengeTriggerName>k__BackingField: TRIGGER_Safety_LogWetFloor
    <IsComplete>k__BackingField: 0
